---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: team.html
title: "Team · Raum & Zeit Physiotherapie"
description: "Team und therapeutische Haltung bei Raum und Zeit Physiotherapie."
currentKey: "team"
---
<section class="page-hero dark"><div class="shell page-hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Team</span><h1 class="display">{{ copy.team.title | escape }}</h1></div><p class="lede">{{ copy.team.intro | escape }}</p></div></section>
{% for member in collections.team %}{% if member.data.featured %}<section class="section"><div class="shell team-feature">{% if member.data.photo %}<div class="photo-placeholder team-photo-real"><img src="{{ member.data.photo }}" alt="{{ member.data.photoAlt or member.data.name }}"></div>{% else %}<div class="photo-placeholder"><span>Fotografie {{ member.data.name }} · final ersetzen</span></div>{% endif %}<div class="team-copy"><span class="eyebrow">{{ member.data.eyebrow }}</span><h2 class="display">{{ member.data.name }}</h2><div class="team-role">{{ member.data.role }}</div>{{ member.templateContent | safe }}{% if member.data.qualifications and member.data.qualifications.length %}<div class="qual-list">{% for q in member.data.qualifications %}<span>{{ q }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</div></div></section>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
<section class="section section-stone"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Weitere Profile</span><h2 class="display">Jede Person bekommt eine echte Rolle, keine austauschbare Teamkarte.</h2><p>Die aktuellen Teamdaten im bestehenden Webauftritt werden vor Veröffentlichung mit Sarah abgeglichen. Der Entwurf hält deshalb bewusst Platz, ohne veraltete Namen als neue Wahrheit zu übernehmen.</p></div><div class="team-grid">
{% for member in collections.team %}{% if not member.data.featured %}<article class="team-card">{% if member.data.photo %}<div class="photo-placeholder team-photo-real"><img src="{{ member.data.photo }}" alt="{{ member.data.photoAlt or member.data.role }}"></div>{% else %}<div class="photo-placeholder"><span>{{ member.data.placeholderLabel }}</span></div>{% endif %}<div class="team-card-copy"><strong>{{ member.data.name or member.data.role }}</strong><span>{% if member.data.name %}{{ member.data.role }}{% else %}{{ member.data.status }}{% endif %}</span>{% if member.templateContent %}<div class="team-card-bio">{{ member.templateContent | safe }}</div>{% endif %}{% if member.data.qualifications and member.data.qualifications.length %}<div class="team-card-quals" aria-label="Qualifikationen">{% for q in member.data.qualifications %}<span>{{ q }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="cta-band"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Karriere</span><h2 class="display">Sie möchten Teil dieser Arbeitsweise werden?</h2></div><a class="button button-light" href="karriere.html">Arbeiten bei Raum &amp; Zeit <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
